Halftone print effect (the `halftone` function and `HALFTONE_INKS` in nodes/main.py)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This part is a NumPy port of the "Halftone CMYK" shader from Paper Shaders
(packages/shaders/src/shaders/halftone-cmyk.ts, commit 7002061d, Vintage preset):
  https://github.com/paper-design/shaders
It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (full text: LICENSE-APACHE).
Changes from the original: GLSL rewritten in NumPy for still images; contrast 1.25 -> 1.1
and ink amount raised to the power 0.85 so mid tones stay closer to the photo; dot size set
by cell count along the long side; grain made from pixel-scaled value noise; dot profile
precomputed as a lookup table; computed in row strips.

